    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben’s Diary – Sad/Difficult",
      "",
      "I’ve discovered that the word “nán guò” is particularly interesting.",
      "It can be one word, but it can also be two words.",
      "",
      "If it’s one word - “nánguò”, then it means “unhappy”.",
      "For example: Lili doesn’t like me, so I feel very sad.",
      "",
      "If it’s two words - “nán/guò”, then it means “very hard to pass”.",
      "For example: The HSK exam is very hard to pass.",
      "",
      "Haha! The HSK exam is very hard to pass, therefore I feel very sad.",
      ""
    ]
  }
